{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>\u26a0\ufe0fNOTE</strong>: This demo build features the following compared to the full game<strong>\u26a0\ufe0f</strong>:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>1 boss (Fuzanglong).</i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/extras/image.png?t=1749921142\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>1 playable Demon (Yellow Demon)</i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/extras/hero.png?t=1749921142\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Leaderboards are disabled.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A feedback link is present at the end of your run.\u00a0</i><strong>\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>\u00a0\u00a0</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/extras/UntiY7G7Gtled.png?t=1749921142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mansa Musa's gold was hidden away within an a cave in the underworld, guarded by vicious demons he had captured on his many journeys.\u00a0As part of King Mansa's purchase of the underworld, he obtained the Spire: A perfect hiding spot for an empire's worth of gold.\u00a0</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/extras/bafkreihog4mkb2io43cqvzxdk6k2fm3tku7lthl3gj7a3xsez62o6ar5ki.jpg?t=1749921142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/extras/Untitl52323555555E0000000555255ed.png?t=1749921142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/extras/ezgif-5775d055bee5de.gif?t=1749921142\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/extras/ezgif-51e0e2757f0534.gif?t=1749921142\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/extras/Untitl555ed.png?t=1749921142\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHAIN SYSTEM</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The CHAIN system rewards you for both collecting and killing in short order. Keep your chain up to massively increase your score!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHAIN CRUSH</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Certain enemies have the ability to preform a CHAIN CRUSH on hit. You will not only take damage from the initial attack, your chain will also be reduced to 0, so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805660?t=1749921142","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/7f310b70fcbd4e35facb647094a759d1fb7a97fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749921142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/cec5e73990d0a9f7550ed2fee8aa6f42d7751aad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749921142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805660/cec5e73990d0a9f7550ed2fee8aa6f42d7751aad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749921142","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed I